{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is a gameplay related to Whale &amp; Sky:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whale &amp; Sky is a 3D shooting game with a technological style. You can use a variety of weapons such as G36,Rifle, Ak to fight against enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will be generated infinitely in the scene. Please pick up the weapon in your hand and get ready to confront them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your health is insufficient, you can choose to restart the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is a story about Whale &amp; Sky:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You woke up from a nightmare, having lost many memories of the past, but you never forgot Lynn with long hair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You recall those times when you fought monsters together with her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More interesting content will be added as the game is updated! Please support me!</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748340?t=1766652205","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748340?t=1766652205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748340/65053e488510f1df79a674c862e8a7a0c94736ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766652205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748340/65053e488510f1df79a674c862e8a7a0c94736ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766652205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is a gameplay related to Whale &amp; Sky:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whale &amp; Sky is a 3D shooting game with a technological style. You can 